1404	        To obtain the same result for $W = Z$, we perform exactly the same steps starting from \Cref{eq:qld-s-good-and-bad} but with $X$ and $Z$ interchanged (so we use \Cref{eq:qld-g-42} instead of \Cref{eq:qld-g-43}). Finally, entirely analogous calculations with the registers swapped yield \Cref{eq:qld-s-point-con-bob}.
