549		POVM $\{\hat{Q}^{\ell}_{f}\}$ acting on $\hilb \ot (\C^q)^{\ot M}$ with
550		outcomes $f \in \deg_{md+1}(\ell)$ such that on average over a uniformly
551		random pair $(\ell, (x,z,\alpha,\beta))$ drawn from the line-point
552		distribution over $\F_q^{2m+2}$,
553		\begin{gather}
554			\label{eq:qld-4-13}
555			\big(\hat{Q}^{\ell}
556			_{[\mathrm{eval}_{(x,z,\alpha,\beta)}(\cdot)=a]}
557			\big)_{\mathsf{A}\mathsf{A}'}
558			\simeq_{\delta_{\mathrm{combine}}}
559			\big(\hat{Q}^{x,z,\alpha,\beta}_{a}\big)_{\mathsf{B}\mathsf{A}''}\,,
