572	Before proving the lemma we record definitions and estimates concerning
573	distributions over lines and points. Recall from
574	Definition~\ref{def:line-point-dist} that the line-point distribution over
575	$\F_q^m$ is an even mixture of an axis-parallel component $D_{\mathrm{ALine}}$
576	and a diagonal component $D_{\mathrm{DLine}}$.
